{"3629320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astrocraft", "steam_appid": 3629320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrocraft is a simulation game about building and managing your own space station. You mine resources, construct buildings, install machinery and equipment, sell goods to space travelers, and hire workers to automate all the operations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/0a627ad71cac39da3e7f55d95d03db0d.poster.avif?t=1784029456\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/0a627ad71cac39da3e7f55d95d03db0d.webm?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/0a627ad71cac39da3e7f55d95d03db0d.mp4?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/043b3f5a8af1a37d86160ff1c4673cec.poster.avif?t=1784029456\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/043b3f5a8af1a37d86160ff1c4673cec.webm?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/043b3f5a8af1a37d86160ff1c4673cec.mp4?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Produce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/41d0db096dc77001b0a167b2d30b744c.poster.avif?t=1784029456\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/41d0db096dc77001b0a167b2d30b744c.webm?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/41d0db096dc77001b0a167b2d30b744c.mp4?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/ffb42e819142262ca1f00eb1b04798dc.poster.avif?t=1784029456\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/ffb42e819142262ca1f00eb1b04798dc.webm?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/ffb42e819142262ca1f00eb1b04798dc.mp4?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/506ca059025f37ccbfc40a9fdf7e7b47.poster.avif?t=1784029456\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/506ca059025f37ccbfc40a9fdf7e7b47.webm?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/extras/506ca059025f37ccbfc40a9fdf7e7b47.mp4?t=1784029456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Customize:</strong> Design your dream space station with modular structures and personal touches to make it uniquely yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Manufacture:</strong> Extract raw resources and transform them into valuable goods through increasingly complex production chains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retail Management:</strong> Run your own cosmic shop, selling products to diverse space travelers from smugglers to diplomats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worker Automation:</strong> Hire specialized staff to handle routine tasks, level them up, and create a self-sustaining operation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Systems:</strong> Protect your hard-earned empire from pirate raids with strategic placement of shields and weaponry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Gameplay:</strong> Journey from manual mining to managing a fully automated, thriving space ecosystem!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer:</strong> Build your station solo or team up with friends for collaborative space entrepreneurship!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Exploration:</strong> Construct hangars for personal ships and venture beyond your station once you've established operations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Events:</strong> Adapt your strategy to handle unexpected situations like massive customer influxes or resource shortages!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrocraft is a simulation game about building and managing your own space station. You mine resources, construct buildings, install machinery and equipment, sell goods to space travelers, and hire workers to automate all the operations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629320/